    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Unexploded is the name of a one-man rock band as well as the alias of its singer-songwriter member. Founded in 2002, Unexploded was asked to perform at several festivals in 2004, but settled for releases on 2 compilations; one in Japan on Stargate Recordings Antenna Volume One in company with amongst others Bill Laswell.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.25,
      "temperature": 0.25,
